{
    "title": "Good Inside: Parenting",
    "description": "We know that you care about the way you parent.\r\n\r\nWe also know that parenting is the hardest and most important job in the world\u2026 And it\u2019s a job with no training and very little support. That\u2019s where we come in.\r\n\r\nMeet Your 24/7 Parenting Coach: The Good Inside App, created by Dr. Becky, is an innovative parenting tool that offers age-based, personalized support in just 5 minutes a day.\r\n\r\nFinally, you can get the immediate impact you\u2019re looking for in the time that you *actually* have. \r\n\r\n*****************************************\r\n\r\nTake a sneak peek at all the good inside:\r\n\r\nPersonalized Support Delivered Daily\r\nFeeling triggered by your kid\u2019s tantrums? Trying to navigate the preteen and teen years? Our 5-minute decks are tailored to your child\u2019s age and your family\u2019s goals. With personalized scripts and strategies, all you need to feel like a sturdy, more confident leader for your family is a few minutes.\r\n\r\nGood Inside Chatbot for Instant Answers to Your Parenting Questions\r\nSometimes, you need an answer like\u2026right now. From how to talk to your kid about death to managing grocery store meltdowns, ask our chatbot anything\u2014it\u2019s like having Dr. Becky in your pocket!\r\n\r\nTimely Reminders to Stay Calm in Moments of Chaos\r\nAs a parent or caregiver, your to-do list is jam-packed already. Take some of the pressure off with personalized reminders to keep the strategies your family needs top of mind in the moments you need them most. \r\n\r\nOn-the-Go Listening for Busy Parents\r\nWhether you're folding a load of laundry, driving to work, or going for a walk, our audio-only feature makes it easy to fit our workshops and videos into the in-between moments throughout your day.\r\n\r\nExclusive Access to Workshops and Events\r\nJoin Dr. Becky along with experts in the top of their field as they dive deeper into tough topics, big questions, and everyday challenges your family is facing, sharing their knowledge directly with you. \r\n\r\nA Private Community Led by Good Inside Coaches\r\nYour village is waiting! Connect with families like yours in dedicated community rooms where our parent coaches provide a safe space to connect, talk, share stories, and get support.",
    "descriptionHTML": "We know that you care about the way you parent.<br><br>We also know that parenting is the hardest and most important job in the world\u2026 And it\u2019s a job with no training and very little support. That\u2019s where we come in.<br><br>Meet Your 24/7 Parenting Coach: The Good Inside App, created by Dr. Becky, is an innovative parenting tool that offers age-based, personalized support in just 5 minutes a day.<br><br>Finally, you can get the immediate impact you\u2019re looking for in the time that you *actually* have. <br><br>*****************************************<br><br>Take a sneak peek at all the good inside:<br><br>Personalized Support Delivered Daily<br>Feeling triggered by your kid\u2019s tantrums? Trying to navigate the preteen and teen years? Our 5-minute decks are tailored to your child\u2019s age and your family\u2019s goals. With personalized scripts and strategies, all you need to feel like a sturdy, more confident leader for your family is a few minutes.<br><br>Good Inside Chatbot for Instant Answers to Your Parenting Questions<br>Sometimes, you need an answer like\u2026right now. From how to talk to your kid about death to managing grocery store meltdowns, ask our chatbot anything\u2014it\u2019s like having Dr. Becky in your pocket!<br><br>Timely Reminders to Stay Calm in Moments of Chaos<br>As a parent or caregiver, your to-do list is jam-packed already. Take some of the pressure off with personalized reminders to keep the strategies your family needs top of mind in the moments you need them most. <br><br>On-the-Go Listening for Busy Parents<br>Whether you&#39;re folding a load of laundry, driving to work, or going for a walk, our audio-only feature makes it easy to fit our workshops and videos into the in-between moments throughout your day.<br><br>Exclusive Access to Workshops and Events<br>Join Dr. Becky along with experts in the top of their field as they dive deeper into tough topics, big questions, and everyday challenges your family is facing, sharing their knowledge directly with you. <br><br>A Private Community Led by Good Inside Coaches<br>Your village is waiting! Connect with families like yours in dedicated community rooms where our parent coaches provide a safe space to connect, talk, share stories, and get support.",
